OL,3,GNEWSATwenty seven people named as 'key
OL,4,Aindividuals' at Omagh bombing inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty seven people have been
OL,7,Fidentified as "key individuals" in the
OL,8,FOmagh bombing investigations, the
OL,9,Finquiry into the atrocity has heard.
OL,11,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,12,Fpregnant with twins, died in the Real
OL,13,FIRA bombing in the County Tyrone town
OL,14,Fon 15 August 1998 - the biggest single
OL,15,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,17,FIt came less than three months after
OL,18,Fthe people of Northern Ireland had
OL,19,Fvoted yes to the Good Friday Agreement.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
