OL,3,GNEWSATwenty seven people named as 'key
OL,4,Aindividuals' at Omagh bombing inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry, which opened last year
OL,7,Fwith 14 days of testimony from bereaved
OL,8,Ffamilies and survivors, was established
OL,9,Fto determine if the bombing could have
OL,10,Fbeen prevented by UK state authorities.
